      "description": "Current number on an enamel plate in its state colour, check digit boxed; safety blue while a person must act.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-plate\"><span class=\"ds-plate-label\">Confirm this number</span><span class=\"ds-cn\">MSCU 123456<span class=\"ds-cd\">7</span></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-plate{font-family:\"Barlow Semi Condensed\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:var(--act,#1f5fa8);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 4px var(--act,#1f5fa8),inset 0 0 0 7px #fff;padding:14px 20px;text-align:center;max-width:420px}.ds-plate-label{display:block;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}.ds-cn{display:block;white-space:nowrap;font-size:clamp(30px,3.1vw,46px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-top:2px}.ds-cd{display:inline-block;border:3px solid currentColor;border-radius:2px;padding:0 .22em;margin-left:.3em;line-height:1.05}"
    },
